<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">Mika</book>
  <para style="h">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mika</para>
  <para style="mt">Mika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai rama Jothama te, Ahaja te, Hezekia te an lal laia Moreset khaw mi, Mika hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng, Samaria leh Jerusalem chungchâng a hmuh chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngte u, ngaithla ula, Lei leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte u, ngaihven rawh u; Lalpa P athian chuan a chênna hmun thianghlim aṭangin A dem che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />En teh u, Lalpa chu a chênna aṭangin a lo kal a, A lo chhuk ang a, lei hmun sângte a rawn rap ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mei bula khawihnûn a tui ṭhîn ang hian Tlângte chu a hmaah chuan an tui ang a, Awih panga tui a luang thlûr sung angin Kawrte pawh a siam seng sung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng hi Jakoba bawhchhiatna avâng leh, Israel chhûngte sualna avâng a ni. Jakoba bawhchhiatna bul chu khawiah nge? Samaria khuaah a ni lâwm ni? Judai ram milem biakna te hi eng nge a bul? Jerusalem khua a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Samaria chu khaw ram, bawlhhlawh chhêkkhâwmna hmunah ka siam ang a, Chutah chuan grepte an chîng ang. A lungte chu kawrruamah ka lum bo vang a, A lungphûmte pawh a chhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An pathian lim zawng zawng ka tikeh sawm ang a, An thilpêk khâwmte pawh ka hâlral ang. An milem zawng zawng ka tichhe vek ang a, An nawhchizawrh hlawh khâwl khâwm chu, Mi dangin nawhchizuar lei nân an hmansak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hei vâng hian lungngaiin ka ṭap ang a, Saruak ke lâwngin ka vâk ruai ang, Sihal angin ka û ang a, Vanghâwngsei angin ka râk tuar tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hliam tuar chu tihdam rual a ni lo, Judai ram a lo thleng ve ta a, Ka mite chênna Jerusalem kawngka hial a lo thlen tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gath khua chu eng mah hrilh suh u, An hriatah ṭap rêng rêng suh u. Beth-le-Afra mite u, vaivut zîngah tâl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Safir hmuna chêngte u, saruak leh zak chungin kal zêl rawh u, Zanan hmuna chêngte chu an lo chhuak ngam lo va, Beth-ezel mite chu mangangin an rûm a, Chu chu in hriat chuan him rual a ni bîk lo tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa hnên ata chhiatna nasa takin Jerusalem kulhkawngka a lo thlen tâk hial avângin Maroth hmuna mite chuan Chhan chhuah hun nghâkhlel takin an thlîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangni, Lakis khaw mite u, Sakawr tawlailîr rual chu buatsaih peih diam rawh u, Nangni hi Zion fanu sualna bul in ni: Israel-te bawhchhiatna chu nangmahni aṭanga chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Moreset-gath chu thlahna thilpêk pe ula, Akzib chhûngkua chu Israel lalte bumtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moresa mite u, nangmahni hnehtu ka rawn tîr dâwn, Israel mi huaisente chu Adulam-a pûkahte an biru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mulukawlh lu ang maiin in fa duh takte sûnin in lu ziat fai rawh u, Salah an hruaisak dâwn si che u a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />An khumlaizâwla thil ṭha lo suangtuaha, Thil sual tih tumte chu an chung a pik e! Zînga khaw ên aṭangin a rem veleh thil ṭha lo an ti nghâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ram an awt a, an lâksak a, Inte an awt a, an chhuhsak zêl mai. An chhûngkuain an tiduhdah a, An rote nên tu mah an him lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “He mite chhiatna tûr hi ka ruahman ta, An pumpelh lo vang, chapo takin an lêng tawh lo vang, An chhiatna hun a thleng dâwn si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan, “Kan ralthûm a ni ta dêr mai, Kan mite ram chanpual chu an sem darh a, Kan lote min chhuhsak a, Min pe kîr lovin sala min mantute a sem ta,” Tih hi nangmah deusawh nân ṭah hlaah an sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan pungkhâwmho zînga ram a sem hunah Chanvo i nei ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Ṭawng suh,’ tiin min ṭawng khum a, “Chûng thu chu sawi teivet suh, Pathian chuan min timualpho lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel chhûngte hi ânchhe dawng em an nih? Lalpa Thlarau chuan dawhtheihna a tlachham ta em ni? Chûng thilte chu a ti duh ang maw? Dik taka khawsa ṭhînte hnênah Thil ṭha a thlen dâwn lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûn maiah khân ka mite chu hmêlma angin in en a, Indona hmun aṭanga ngaihngam taka ina lo hâwte chu an puan leh kawr in hlihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mi, hmeichhiate chu, an in nuam tak ata in hnawt chhuak a, An fate hnêna malsâwmna ka pêkte chu in lâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tho ula, chhuak thuai rawh u, Hei hi in tân hmun râlmuang a ni lo, In khawlohna avângin he hmun hi tihchhiat vek a ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi dawthei leh bumhmang vâk vêlte chuan, ‘Uain leh zu kan pe ṭeuh vang che u,’ ti se, Chutiang mite chu he mite zâwlnei ni âwm lek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Jakob-ho, in vaiin ka hruai khâwm ngei ngei ang che u, Israel mi, la damte pawh ka la khâwm ngei ang. Phûla berâm tla dual dual leh Huanga an lawi dum dum angin ka hruai khâwm ang a, Tichuan, mipui an sa mur mur tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kawng hawngtu chuan hma a hruai ang a, an lût hum hum ang. An lal leh hotu, Lalpa chuan an hma a hruai ang a, Ani chu an innghahna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangni Jakoba chhûngte chunga hotute leh Israel-te zînga rorêltute u, ngaithla rawh u, Rorêl dân dik hre tûr in ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangni thil ṭha huaa, thil sual ngainate u, Ka mite vun in lip a, an ruha tî in hlehsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mite chu in ei a, an vun in lip a, An ruh te in titliak a, thlêngah in chan darh a, Bêla chhum tûrin an sa in chan sawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chu au mah se a chhâng lo vang, Chutih hunah chuan an lakah a hmêl a thup zâwk ang. Thil sual an tih reng avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mite hruaikawitu zâwlneite chungthu-ah Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Ei tûr petu hnênah chuan, ‘A muanawm e,’ an ti a, Ei tûr pe duh lotu chu ensanah an vau a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, inlârna awm lo, zân thim a thleng ang a, Hrilhlâwkna awm lo thimin a nang ang che u. Zâwlneite nî a liam ang a, an tân hun thim a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmutheitute an zak ang a, hrilhlâwktute an mualpho vang, Pathianin a chhân loh avângin an vaiin zakin an kun reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei erawh chu Jakoba bawhchhiatna leh Israel sual puang chhuak tûrin Lalpa Thlarau chuan thiltihtheihna te, Dikna te leh chakna tein min thuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakoba leh Israel chhûngte chunga hotu leh rorêltu, Dikna ngainêpa, thu dik dâwta chantîr ṭhînte u, Hei hi hre rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion chu thisenin in sa a, Jerusalem pawh suahsualnain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rorêltute chuan thamna beiseiin ro an rêl a, Puithiamte pawhin hlawh ûmin an zirtîr a, Zâwlneiten sum beiseiin thu an puang a; Chuti chung chuan ngaihngam taka Lalpa ṭawng chhanin, ‘ Lalpa chu kan hnênah a awm a, Kan chungah chhiatna eng mah a thleng lo vang,’ an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, nangmahni avângin Zion chu lo anga leh phut a ni ang a, Jerusalem pawh a chhe rem rum ang a, Tempul awmna tlâng chu ramhnuai a chang zo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni hnuhnûnghahte chuan Lalpa awmna tlâng chu Tlâng ropui ber a la ni ang a, Tlâng zawng zawng a khûm vek ang. Tah chuan mi tinrêng an lo kal duah duah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam tam tak an lo kal ang a, heti hian an ti ang: ‘Hawh u, Lalpa tlângah i chho vang u, Jakoba Pathian in awmnaah chuan, A kawng min lo kawhhmuh ang a, A kawngah chuan kan kal ang,’ Zion aṭangin dân chu a lo chhuak ang a, Jerusalem aṭang hian Lalpa chuan thu a sawi ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tin inkâr thu a rêl ang a, Hla taka hnam chak takte thu pawh a remsak ang. An khandaihte lei leh nân an chher ang a, An feite chu thei ṭang tanna kawmah an siam bawk ang. Hnam dang chungah hnam dangin hriam an lek tawh lo vang a, Indo dân pawh an zir tawh hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi tin mahni grep leh theipui hlimah an ṭhu ang a, Tu mah an hlau lo vang, Engkim Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hnam tinin mahni pathian ṭheuh an bia ang a, A thu an zâwm ang, Keini pawhin kan Pathian Lalpa chu kan bia ang a, A thu kan zâwm kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Chumi ni chuan kebaite ka khâwm ang a, Saltângte leh ka hrem tuarte chu ka hruai khâwm ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kebaite chu hnam tundinna bul atân ka hmang ang a, Hnawh darhte chu hnam chak takah ka siam ang. Lalpa chuan Zion tlângah chatuanin ro a rêlsak tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw nang, ran rual vênna in sâng, Zion fanute chênna tlâng, Tûn hmaa in ram chu in nei leh dâwn a, Jerusalem mite chu an ram pêk an ni leh dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engtizia nge i ṭah vak vak le? Lal i nei na nge? Remruatsaktu che chu a awm ta na nge? Hmeichhe nau vei angin natnain a man tâk che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Zion fanu, hmeichhe nau vei angin tâl la, rûm rawh, Ramhnuaia awm tûrin khawpui chhuahsan rawh, Babulon-ah kal la, tah chuan i him ang. Chuta ṭang chuan Lalpa chuan i hmêlmate kut ata a tlan chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnam tam tak an pung khâwm ang a, an do rawn ang a, ‘Zion chu tibawrhbâng ila, i thlîr zui teh ang u,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpa rilru an hmu lo va, A remruat an hrethiam hek lo, Ani chuan hruiha chîl tûr buhphal angin Anni chu a seng khâwm ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Zion fanu, tho la, anni chu rap hrep rawh, Thîr ki ka pe ang chia, dâr tinkâwm ka pe bawk ang che, Chu chuan mi tam tak i tisawm vek dâwn nia. Mi thil an lâksakte chu Lalpa hnênah rawn hlân ula, An sum leh pai te pawh lei pum pui neitu Lalpa hnênah hlân ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khawpui kulh chhûnga mite u, in sipaite kha khâwm rawh u, Min hual tâk hi, Israel hruaitu pawh a bekah tiangin an vuak dâwn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang Bethlehem, Efrata, Judai khawpui zîngah tê hle mah la, I chhûng aṭangin Israel rorêltu ka tân a lo chhuak dâwn si a, Ani chu hmasâng ata thlahtu bul aṭanga lo chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nau veiin a hrin hma chu Lalpan a mite chu a hawisan ang, Tichuan, a unau la dam zawngte chu an lo kîr ang a, Israel zîngah an tel ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian Lalpa hming ropui tak leh Lalpa chakna chuan a mite chu A vêng ang a, a châwm ang, Lei pum puiah a ropui dâwn êm a, A mite chu thlamuang takin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hetiang hian remna a awm dâwn a ni: ‘Asuria-in kan ram an rawn rûn a, Kan kulhah te an lo luh pawhin vêngtu leh hruaitu tam tâwk nên ka lo do lêt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asuria ram chu khandaihin an hneh ang a, Nimroda ram chuan khandaih hriam an tuar ang. Asuria-in kan ram an rûn a, ramri an lo thlen chuan, Ani chuan min chhanhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakoba thlah la awm chhunte chu hnam tam tak tân Lalpa hnên aṭanga daifîm tla, Thlai châwmtu ruah ang an ni ang. Mihringah an innghat tawh lo vang a, Tu mah an rinchhan tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jakoba thlah la awm chhunte chu Hnamte leh mi tam tak tân Ramsa zînga sakeibaknei ang an ni ang a, Berâm rual zînga sakeibaknei vânglai A kalna apianga berâm seha pawtsawm ṭhîn, Tu ma ngam loh ang hi an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I hmêlmate chungah i kut i lek ang a, I hmêlma zawng zawng chu tihboral an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan in sakawrte ka lâk bosak ang che u a, In tawlailîrte ka tichhia ang,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘In ram chhûnga khawpuite ka tichhia ang a, In kulh zawng zawng ka tichim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In dawithiam ka tichhia ang a, Aienthiam in nei tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In milim te, lung serh in phun te ka tihchhiatsak ang che u a, In kutchhuakte chu chibai in bûk tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In pathiannu, Aseri lim in phunte chu Ka nam tlûksak ang che u. In khawpuite ka tichhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thu awih lo hnamte chungah chuan Thinur takin phuba ka la ang.’
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khai le, Lalpa thu hi lo ngaithla teh u, Aw Lalpa , i chungthu hi tlângte hrilh la, Mualten i thu sawi hi lo hre teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlângte u, Lalpan a mite a demna hi lo hria ula, Nangni, leilung nghahchhan hlunte u, ngaithla teh u. Lalpa chuan a mite a dem a, Israel-te chu a khing ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka mite u, engtin nge maw ka lo tih che u le? Eng kawngin nge ka tihhah che u, Min chhâng teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuak che u a, In saltânna ram ata ka tlan chhuak che u a, In hruaitu atân Mosia te, Arona te, Miriami te ka rawn tîr a nih kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw, ka mite u, Moab lal Balaka thil ruahman kha hre reng ta che u, Beora fapa Balaama chhânnate pawh kha, Sitim aṭanga Gilgal in thlen thlenga In thil tawnte kha hre reng ula, Lalpa thil tih dikzia kha in hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah eng nên nge ka kal anga, Pathian Chungnungbera chu engtin nge chibai ka bûk ang? Bâwngno kum khat tling hâlral thilhlanah Ka hlân dâwn em ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Berâm sâng tam tak leh hriak luipui sâng sâwmah te Lalpa chu a lâwm dâwn em ni? Ka sual avângin ka fa tîr chu ka hlân ang a, Ka bawhchhiat manah ka rîla rah chu ka hlân ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw mihring, thil ṭha chu a entîr tawh che a ni lâwm ni? Lalpan a phût che chu eng nge ni? Dik taka thil tih te, khawngaihna ngainat te, Thuhnuairawlh taka i Pathian nêna lên dun te hi a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I hming ṭih hi a finthlâk a ni, Lalpa chuan khawpui chu ring takin a au va, ‘Khawpuia pung khâwm hnamte u, ngaithla rawh u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mi sualin an ina thil bawlhhlawh an chhêk khâwm te, Tehna dik lo an hmang te hi ka hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bûk ngul dik lo leh bûklung dik lo hmangtute chu Ka hrem ngei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In mi hausate nun a râwng hle a, Mipui pawh dawthei, mi bum chîng in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In sualnate avângin na takin ka hrem ang che u a, Ka ti ṭiau vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In ei ang a, in tlai lo vang, in ril a ṭâm reng ang. In chhêk khâwm ang a, in hum chuang lo vang, In khâwl sa pawh khandaihin ka tichhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlai in chîng ang a, a rah in seng lo vang, Oliv in her ang a, a hriak in ei lo vang, Grep in sâwr ang a, a uain in in chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Omria awm dân angin in awm a, Ahaba chhûngkaw sualna zawng zawng in ti ve a, An awm dân in lâk avângin khawpuia awm zawng zawng, Ka tiboral vek ang a, Mite nuihzatbûr leh hmuhsit in ni ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mang a va ang êm! Nipui thei leh grep ṭo Zawngtu ang mai ka ni. Ka châk êm êm grep leh theipui hmin hmasa A awm tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leiah hian mi rinawm an awm tawh lo, Mi nun ngîl tu mah an awm tawh hek lo; Thisen chhuah tumin an inchâng ṭheuh va, Mahni unau pawh man tumin an inveh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil sual tih an thiam hle a, Hruaituten thilpêk an phût a, Rorêltuten thamna an ngiat a, Thiltitheite an duh duhin an pâwt a, Chutiang ti tûr chuan an inlungrual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An zînga mi ṭha ber pawh buar ang chauh a ni, Mi dik ber pawh hnimhlîngnei ang mai a ni. Anmahni vêngtuin a sawi lâwk tawh angin Hrem an tuar ni a lo hnai ta. Tûnah pawh an chiai ta hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I ṭhenawmte ring suh la, i ṭhian bulte chungah innghat suh, I nupui pawm lai ngei pawh eng mah hrilh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fapain a pa a hmusit a, Fanuin a nu a pawisa lo va, Movin a pasala nu a do vang. Mihring hmêlma chu ama chhûngkaw zînga mi ngei a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan Lalpa ka thlîr a, Min chhandamtu Pathian chu ka nghâk reng ang, Ka Pathian chuan ka aw a ngaithla dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hmêlmapa, min dichim suh, Tlu mah ila ka tho leh dâwn, Thimah awm mah ila Lalpa chu ka êng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chungah thil sual ka tih avângin A zilhna tuar tûr rêng ka ni, Ka chungthu a rêl fel a, Ka dikna a târlan hma chu, Tichuan, êngah min la chhuak ang a, A felzia chu ka hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Khawiah nge Lalpa , i Pathian chu?” titu ka hmêlma chuan a hmu ang a, a zak hle ang; Ka mit ngeiin a tlu lai ka hmu ang a, Tuallaia chirhdiak angin an rap ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I kulh bangte din thar ni a lo thleng dâwn, Chumi ni chuan in ram china ruat chu tihzau a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Asuria aṭang te, Aigupta khawpui aṭang te, Aigupta leh Eufretis lui inkâr aṭang te, Tuifinriat leh tuifinriat inkâr aṭang te, Tlângram hla tak tak aṭang te chuan i hnênah, I mite chu an lo kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram luahtute thil sual tih mawh chu ramin a phur ang a, Ram chu a ṭiau vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I mi, i ro chante chu, i tiangin vêng la, Ngaw hnuaia khawhar taka awmte chu Hnimhring hmunah hruai chhuak rawh. Tûn hma ang khân tlattîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga in lo chhuah lai nite ang khân, Anni chu ka thil tih mak ka hmuhtîr ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ropui hle mah se hnamte chuan an hmu ang a, An hrilh a hai hle ang. An kâ an hup ang a, An bengte pawh an tingawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rûl angin vaivut an liak ang a, Leia rannung bawkvâka kalte ang mai an ni ang. An kulh aṭangin thlabârin an lo chhuak ang a, Lalpa , kan Pathian chu, an rawn pan ang, An hlau êm êm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang anga sualte ngaidama, Rochan la awmte khawlohna la bo ṭhîn. Pathian dang an awm em? Nang zawng, i thinur reng lo va, Khawngaihna lantîr hi i lâwmzâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kan chungah ngilneihna i lantîr leh ang a, Kan sual zawng zawng min hnehsak ang a, Kan khawlohna zawng zawng Tuifinriat mawngah i thlâk dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmasânga kan pute hnêna i tiam tawh ang khân, Jakoba lakah i rinawm a, Abrahama chungah khawngaihna i lantîr ta.
  </para>
</usx>
